#: src/Admin/Settings.php:235
msgid "Shoplex (EU Compliance)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:239
msgid ""
"Shoplex is active. Check under WooCommerce > Shoplex which of its modules "
"(lowest price from the last 30 days, VAT notice, withdrawal information) are "
